OL,4,CVerstappen says Russell below        W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GWarning: This article contains       W5
OL,7,Goffensive language                   W5
OL,8,                                      W5
OL,9,GMax Verstappen was a constant amid   W5
OL,10,Gthe chaos at a remarkable Las Vegas  W5
OL,11,GGrand Prix.                          W5
OL,12,                                      W5
OL,13,GHe was the star figure in a race     W5
OL,14,Gthat had 34 overtaking moves for the W5
OL,15,Glead in 50 laps and 352 overall, in  W5
OL,16,Gwhich the biggest advantage the      W5
OL,17,Gleader ever had was 1.5 seconds, and W5
OL,18,Gin which there were five cars        W5
OL,19,Gfighting nose to tail for the lead   W5
OL,20,Gto the final lap, and for much of    W5
OL,21,Gthe race many more than that.        W5
OL,22,                                      W5
